cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RADAR, please cite the software and the article below."
type: software
title: "RADAR: Raman spectral Analysis using Deep learning for Artifact Removal (Python package)"
abstract: >-
  Python package that splits Raman spectra into baseline, cosmic rays, noise
  and peaks with two pre-trained convolutional neural networks (standard and
  ensemble), with a synthetic data generator, training and evaluation tools,
  and file input/output for the common Raman formats.
version: 0.1.0
